 "intro_html": "The vegan dashi: <b>kombu</b> gives a clean, savoury base and <b>dried shiitake</b> add a deep, earthy one. Cold brewing overnight is the easiest and gentlest way — nothing to watch. Don’t throw out the shiitake afterwards: slice them for the <a href=\"napa-shiitake-egg-bowl.html\">napa cabbage &amp; shiitake egg bowl</a>.",
