  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Fridge in a closed jar for 3–4 days.</li><li>Freezes well in ice-cube trays — a cube or two is perfect for a single bowl.</li></ul>",
   "title_html": "Storage"
  },
  {
   "html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>10 g kombu + 4–5 shiitake per litre is a standard starting point.</li><li>For a stronger dashi, add another shiitake or two.</li></ul>",
