   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Into a jar, everything cold:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>kombu <span class=\"amt\">10 g</span></li><li>dried shiitake <span class=\"amt\">4–5 (about 15 g)</span></li><li>water <span class=\"amt\">1 l</span></li></ul></li><li>Lid on, into the fridge for <b>8–24 hours</b>.</li></ul>",
