   "uses_rows": []
  },
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Into a saucepan, everything cold:<ul class=\"ing\"><li>kombu <span class=\"amt\">10 g</span></li><li>dried shiitake <span class=\"amt\">4–5 (about 15 g)</span></li><li>water <span class=\"amt\">1 l</span></li></ul></li><li>Soak for at least 30 minutes (longer is better).</li></ul>",
   "heat": null,
